      "id": "claim_218bef28544d4093852784d1718ed879",
      "statement": "The Splitter ABC defines belongs_to_same_document (returning DocGroups2), split_lazy_doc_group, and split_eager_doc_group, and provides a sliding-window pairing helper with page_per_split=2 producing N-1 overlapping pairs plus aggregate_doc_groups that converts pairwise results into final DocGroup page lists by extending on True and splitting on False.",
